    rdfs:comment "PHARMACEUTICAL measures from the JRC-biological taxonomy. These fall OUTSIDE the WHO PHSM scope (which is non-pharmaceutical). Aligned with the ECMO Medical Countermeasures (mcmc) branch; retained here so an EWRS record can carry any JRC response-measure code."@en ;
    phsm:fromSourceTaxonomy phsm:src_JRC_Biological ;
    skos:prefLabel "Medical countermeasure and prophylaxis measures"@en .
